 end="01:03.330">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.330" end="01:13.980"><span begin="01:03.330" end="01:03.570">I </span><span begin="01:03.570" end="01:06.030">guess </span><span begin="01:06.030" end="01:08.160">it's </span><span begin="01:08.160" end="01:09.900">seen </span><span begin="01:09.900" end="01:10.080">the </span><span begin="01:10.080" end="01:12.270">sparks </span><span begin="01:12.270" end="01:12.540">a</span><span begin="01:12.540" end="01:12.570">-</span><span begin="01:12.570" end="01:13.980">flowin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.980" end="01:34.920"><span begin="01:13.980" end="01:14.040">no</span><span begin="01:14.040" end="01:17.670">-</span><span begin="01:17.670" end="01:22.650">one </span><span begin="01:22.650" end="01:24.900">else </span><span begin="01:24.900" end="01:25.590">would </span><span begin="01:25.590" end="01:30.840">know</span><span begin="01:30.840" end="01:34.920">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.920" end="01:51.420"><span begin="01:34.920" end="01:37.380">Hey </span><span begin="01:37.380" end="01:39.600">man' </span><span begin="01:39.600" end="01:40.290">slow </span><span begin="01:40.290" end="01:44.280">down' </span><span begin="01:44.280" end="01:49.230">slow </span><span begin="01:49.230" end="01:51.420">down'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.420" end="02:17.310"><span begin="01:51.420" end="01:53.850">idiot' </span><span begin="01:53.850" end="01:54.600">slow </span><span begin="01:54.600" end="01:58.440">down' </span><span begin="01:58.440" end="01:59.160">slow </span><span begin="01:59.160" end="02:04.710">down</span><span begin="02:04.710" end="02:17.310">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.310" end="02:32.070"><span begin="02:22.310" end="02:22.530">Sometimes </span><span begin="02:22.530" end="02:24.060">I </span><span begin="02:24.060" end="02:24.660">get </span><span begin="02:24.660" end="02:32.070">overcharged'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.070" end=